OL,3,CJaguar Land Rover set to cut jobs amid
OL,4,Coverhaul
OL,6,FJaguar Land Rover has revealed plans
OL,7,Fto cut hundreds of jobs less than a
OL,8,Fyear after it had to halt production
OL,9,Ffollowing a major cyber attack.
OL,11,FThe company makes most of its cars in
OL,12,Ffactories in the UK, including
OL,13,FHalewood on Merseyside.
OL,15,FIt is understood that fewer than 300
OL,16,Fjobs will be affected.
OL,18,FThe company is the UK's largest car
OL,19,Fmaker and employs about 30,000 people
OL,20,Facross the UK and roughly 10,000
OL,21,Foverseas.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
