CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785482286
OL,3,CJaguar Land Rover set to cut jobs amid
OL,4,Coverhaul
OL,6,FAs well as Halewood, JLR also has
OL,7,Ffactories in Solihull, West Midlands
OL,8,Fand Slovakia, but did not disclose
OL,9,Fwhere jobs will be hit.
OL,11,FA company spokesman said: "As we
OL,12,Fevolve our operating model to
OL,13,Faccelerate the growth of our house of
OL,14,Fbrands and deliver our next-generation
OL,15,Fvehicles, we are transforming our
OL,16,Fbusiness to improve decision-making
OL,17,Fand performance.
OL,26,@sD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
