OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785482286
OL,3,CJaguar Land Rover set to cut jobs amid
OL,4,Coverhaul
OL,6,F"As part of our ongoing transformation
OL,7,Finitiatives, we have launched a
OL,8,Flimited redeployment and displacement
OL,9,Fprogramme.
OL,11,F"Impacted colleagues will be supported
OL,12,Fto find alternative roles wherever
OL,13,Fpossible, alongside the option of
OL,14,Fvoluntary early exit."
OL,16,FLast month, JLR said it planned to cut
OL,17,Faround #1.7 billion in costs over the
OL,18,Fcoming years to help support its
OL,19,Frecovery.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@VO]
