OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785482286
OL,3,CJaguar Land Rover set to cut jobs amid
OL,4,Coverhaul
OL,6,FIt indicated it would secure the
OL,7,Fsavings through cuts in areas like
OL,8,Fmaterials, warranty and fixed costs.
OL,10,FJLR has been recovering from a cyber
OL,11,Fattack last year which had major
OL,12,Fimpact on the business, its employees
OL,13,Fand the wider UK economy.
OL,15,FThe carmaker was forced to stop
OL,16,Fproduction at its UK factories for
OL,17,Ffive weeks from September 1 last year,
OL,18,Fwhich weighed on sales in late 2025
OL,19,Fand led to heavy financial losses.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
